sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(UI BFF / CLI / SDK)
    participant Istio as Istio IngressGateway<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Proxy as model-registry proxy<br/>8080/TCP mTLS
    participant DB as MySQL 3306/TCP<br/>or PostgreSQL 5432/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant ISVC as InferenceService CR
    participant Controller as MR Controller
    participant CSI as mr-storage-initializer
    participant AsyncJob as async-upload Job
    participant S3 as S3/OCI Storage<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Sigstore as Sigstore<br/>443/TCP TLS

    Note over Client,DB: Flow 1: Model Registration via REST API
    Client->>Istio: POST /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models<br/>Auth: OAuth2/OIDC
    Istio->>Proxy: Forward (mTLS via mesh)<br/>Istio AuthorizationPolicy
    Proxy->>DB: INSERT model metadata<br/>Auth: username/password
    DB-->>Proxy: Result
    Proxy-->>Istio: 201 Created (JSON)
    Istio-->>Client: Response

    Note over Controller,Proxy: Flow 2: InferenceService Reconciliation
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: InferenceService created/updated<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>Proxy: POST/PATCH serving metadata<br/>8080/TCP mTLS, Bearer token
    Proxy->>DB: Upsert serving environment + inference service
    DB-->>Proxy: Result
    Proxy-->>Controller: 200 OK
    Controller->>K8sAPI: PATCH InferenceService labels<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over CSI,Proxy: Flow 3: Model Storage Initialization (CSI)
    ISVC->>CSI: Init container starts<br/>model-registry:// URI
    CSI->>Proxy: GET model artifact location<br/>8080/TCP mTLS
    Proxy->>DB: Query artifact URI
    DB-->>Proxy: Artifact storage URI
    Proxy-->>CSI: Artifact location (S3/GCS URI)
    CSI->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>443/TCP TLS, per-storage credentials
    S3-->>CSI: Model files

    Note over AsyncJob,Sigstore: Flow 4: Async Model Upload
    AsyncJob->>S3: Download model from source<br/>443/TCP TLS, AWS IAM / Docker auth
    S3-->>AsyncJob: Model files
    AsyncJob->>Sigstore: Sign model (Fulcio/Rekor)<br/>443/TCP TLS, OIDC token
    Sigstore-->>AsyncJob: Signature
    AsyncJob->>S3: Upload to destination<br/>443/TCP TLS, AWS IAM / Docker auth
    S3-->>AsyncJob: Upload confirmed
    AsyncJob->>Proxy: Register model + artifact<br/>443/TCP TLS, Bearer token
    Proxy->>DB: INSERT model + version + artifact
    DB-->>Proxy: Result
    Proxy-->>AsyncJob: 201 Created
